   "AdditionJobRequirements": "<ul><li>Age 30 to 35 years</li><li>Only Male</li></ul> <ul><li>Regular on-site presence is required to support campus operations, laboratories, infrastructure, and the IT team.</li><li>The role may require evening, weekend, or on-call work for maintenance, upgrades, examinations, major events, or critical incidents.</li><li>The person must be willing to work on a roster basis. Friday is a university working day, and Sunday is the weekly closure day.    </li><li>The role may require travel among university buildings, campuses, data center facilities, and vendor locations.</li></ul>",
